msgid "# Speculative Decoding Guide"
msgstr "# 推测解码指南"

msgid ""
"This guide shows how to use Speculative Decoding with vLLM Ascend. "
"Speculative decoding is a technique which improves inter-token latency in "
"memory-bound LLM inference."
msgstr "本指南介绍如何在 vLLM Ascend 中使用推测解码。推测解码是一种在内存受限的 LLM 推理中改善令牌间延迟的技术。"

msgid "## Overview"
msgstr "## 概述"

msgid ""
"vLLM Ascend implements speculative decoding through a **proposer-verifier** "
"architecture:"
msgstr "vLLM Ascend 通过**提议者-验证者**架构实现推测解码："

msgid ""
"1. **Proposer** (`vllm_ascend/spec_decode/`): Generates draft (speculative) tokens using various methods — from simple n-gram matching to neural-network-based draft models.\n"
"2. **Rejection Sampler** (`vllm_ascend/sample/`): Verifies draft tokens against the target model's output, accepting matches and rejecting mismatches, with optional optimizations including [Block Verify and Entropy Verify](#block-verify-and-entropy-verify)."
msgstr ""
"1. **提议者** (`vllm_ascend/spec_decode/`)：使用多种方法生成草稿（推测）令牌——从简单的 n-gram 匹配到基于神经网络的草稿模型。\n"
"2. **拒绝采样器** (`vllm_ascend/sample/`)：根据目标模型的输出验证草稿令牌，接受匹配项并拒绝不匹配项，可选的优化包括[块验证和熵验证](#block-verify-and-entropy-verify)。"

msgid "The following speculative decoding methods are supported:"
msgstr "支持以下推测解码方法："

msgid "## Common Configuration"
msgstr "## 通用配置"

msgid ""
"All speculative decoding methods are configured through the "
"`speculative_config` parameter when initializing the model or starting the "
"server:"
msgstr "所有推测解码方法在初始化模型或启动服务器时通过 `speculative_config` 参数进行配置："

msgid ""
"**Offline inference** — pass `speculative_config` as a Python dict to "
"`LLM()`:"
msgstr "**离线推理** — 将 `speculative_config` 作为 Python 字典传递给 `LLM()`："

msgid ""
"**Online serving** — pass `--speculative-config` (or `-sc`) as a JSON "
"string:"
msgstr "**在线服务** — 将 `--speculative-config`（或 `-sc`）作为 JSON 字符串传递："

msgid ""
"> [!NOTE]\n"
"> On Ascend NPUs, the `npu_fused_infer_attention_score` operator supports a maximum of 16 tokens per decode round. Therefore, `(num_speculative_tokens + 1)` must be ≤ 16."
msgstr ""
"> [!NOTE]\n"
"> 在 Ascend NPU 上，`npu_fused_infer_attention_score` 算子每轮解码最多支持 16 个令牌。因此，`(num_speculative_tokens + 1)` 必须 ≤ 16。"

msgid "## Speculating by matching n-grams in the prompt"
msgstr "## 通过匹配提示中的 n-gram 进行推测"

msgid ""
"The following code configures vLLM Ascend to use speculative decoding where "
"proposals are generated by matching n-grams in the prompt."
msgstr "以下代码配置 vLLM Ascend 使用推测解码，其中通过匹配提示中的 n-gram 生成提议。"

msgid "## Speculating using EAGLE based draft models"
msgstr "## 使用基于 EAGLE 的草稿模型进行推测"

msgid ""
"The following code configures vLLM Ascend to use speculative decoding where "
"proposals are generated by an [EAGLE (Extrapolation Algorithm for Greater "
"Language-model Efficiency)](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2401.15077) based draft "
"model."
msgstr ""
"以下代码配置 vLLM Ascend 使用推测解码，其中提议由基于 [EAGLE（Extrapolation Algorithm for Greater"
" Language-model Efficiency）](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2401.15077) 的草稿模型生成。"

msgid ""
"A few important things to consider when using the EAGLE based draft models:"
msgstr "使用基于 EAGLE 的草稿模型时需要考虑的几个重要事项："

msgid ""
"1. The EAGLE draft models available in the [HF repository for EAGLE models](https://huggingface.co/yuhuili) should\n"
"   be loaded and used directly by vLLM. This functionality was added in PR [#4893](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/4893).\n"
"   If you are using a vLLM version released before this pull request was merged, please update to a more recent version."
msgstr ""
"1. [HF 仓库中的 EAGLE 模型](https://huggingface.co/yuhuili) 提供的 EAGLE 草稿模型应由 vLLM 直接加载和使用。此功能在 PR [#4893](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/4893) 中添加。\n"
"   如果您使用的 vLLM 版本在此拉取请求合并之前发布，请更新到更新版本。"

msgid ""
"2. The EAGLE based draft models need to be run without tensor parallelism\n"
"   (i.e. draft_tensor_parallel_size is set to 1 in `speculative_config`), although\n"
"   it is possible to run the main model using tensor parallelism (see example above)."
msgstr ""
"2. 基于 EAGLE 的草稿模型需要在没有张量并行的情况下运行\n"
"   （即 `speculative_config` 中的 draft_tensor_parallel_size 设置为 1），尽管\n"
"   主模型可以使用张量并行运行（参见上面的示例）。"

msgid ""
"3. When using EAGLE-3 based draft model, option \"method\" must be set to \"eagle3\".\n"
"   That is, to specify `\"method\": \"eagle3\"` in `speculative_config`."
msgstr ""
"3. 使用基于 EAGLE-3 的草稿模型时，选项 \"method\" 必须设置为 \"eagle3\"。\n"
"   也就是说，在 `speculative_config` 中指定 `\"method\": \"eagle3\"`。"

msgid ""
"4. After enabling EAGLE, the main model needs to verify `(1 + K)` tokens generated by the main model and the draft model in one decoding process.\n"
"   And the fullgraph mode will fix the number of tokens during the verification stage,\n"
"   so `cudagraph_capture_sizes` must be a list of capture sizes, where each size is calculated as `n * (K + 1)` for each batch size `n` you want to support.\n"
"   For instance, to support batch sizes from 1 to 4 with `num_speculative_tokens = 4`, `cudagraph_capture_sizes` should be set to `[5, 10, 15, 20]`."
msgstr ""
"4. 启用 EAGLE 后，主模型需要在一个解码过程中验证主模型和草稿模型生成的 `(1 + K)` 个令牌。\n"
"   并且全图模式将固定验证阶段的令牌数量，\n"
"   因此 `cudagraph_capture_sizes` 必须是一个捕获大小列表，其中每个大小计算为 `n * (K + 1)`，`n` 是您想要支持的每个批次大小。\n"
"   例如，要支持批次大小从 1 到 4 且 `num_speculative_tokens = 4`，`cudagraph_capture_sizes` 应设置为 `[5, 10, 15, 20]`。"

msgid "## Speculating using MTP"
msgstr "## 使用 MTP 进行推测"

msgid ""
"MTP (Multi-Token Prediction) boosts inference performance by parallelizing "
"the prediction of multiple tokens, shifting from single-token to multi-token"
" generation. This approach significantly increases generation throughput and"
" achieves multiplicative acceleration in inference speed — all without "
"compromising output quality."
msgstr ""
"MTP（多令牌预测）通过并行化预测多个令牌，将生成方式从单令牌转变为多令牌，从而提升推理性能。这种方法显著提高了生成吞吐量，并实现了推理速度的倍增加速——同时不牺牲输出质量。"

msgid ""
"> [!NOTE]\n"
"> Due to the fact that only a single layer of weights is exposed in DeepSeek's MTP, accuracy and performance are not effectively guaranteed in scenarios where `num_speculative_tokens > 1` (especially ≥ 3).\n"
">\n"
"> In the fullgraph mode with `num_speculative_tokens > 1`, the capture size of each ACLGraph must be an integer multiple of `(num_speculative_tokens + 1)`."
msgstr ""
"> [!NOTE]\n"
"> 由于 DeepSeek 的 MTP 仅暴露单层权重，在 `num_speculative_tokens > 1`（尤其是 ≥ 3）的场景下，精度和性能无法得到有效保证。\n"
">\n"
"> 在 `num_speculative_tokens > 1` 的全图模式下，每个 ACLGraph 的捕获大小必须是 `(num_speculative_tokens + 1)` 的整数倍。"

msgid "## Speculating using Suffix Decoding"
msgstr "## 使用后缀解码进行推测"

msgid ""
"The following code configures vLLM to use speculative decoding where "
"proposals are generated using Suffix Decoding [(SuffixDecoding: Extreme "
"Speculative Decoding for Emerging AI "
"Applications)](https://arxiv.org/abs/2411.04975)."
msgstr ""
"以下代码配置 vLLM 使用推测解码，其中候选令牌通过后缀解码生成 [(SuffixDecoding: Extreme Speculative "
"Decoding for Emerging AI Applications)](https://arxiv.org/abs/2411.04975)。"

msgid ""
"Like n-gram, Suffix Decoding can generate draft tokens by pattern-matching "
"using the last `n` generated tokens. Unlike n-gram, Suffix Decoding (1) can "
"pattern-match against both the prompt and previous generations, (2) uses "
"frequency counts to propose the most likely continuations, and (3) "
"speculates an adaptive number of tokens for each request at each iteration "
"to get better acceptance rates."
msgstr ""
"与 n-gram 类似，后缀解码可以通过使用最后 `n` 个生成的令牌进行模式匹配来生成草稿令牌。与 n-gram 不同，后缀解码 (1) "
"可以针对提示和先前生成的内容进行模式匹配，(2) 使用频率计数来提出最可能的续写内容，以及 (3) "
"在每次迭代中为每个请求推测自适应数量的令牌，以获得更好的接受率。"

msgid ""
"Suffix Decoding can achieve better performance for tasks with high "
"repetition, such as code-editing, agentic loops (e.g. self-reflection, self-"
"consistency), and RL rollouts."
msgstr "后缀解码在具有高重复性的任务上可以实现更好的性能，例如代码编辑、智能体循环（例如自我反思、自我一致性）和强化学习展开。"

msgid ""
"> [!NOTE]\n"
"> Suffix Decoding requires Arctic Inference. You can install it with `pip install arctic-inference`."
msgstr ""
"> [!NOTE]\n"
"> 后缀解码需要 Arctic Inference。您可以使用 `pip install arctic-inference` 进行安装。"

msgid "## Extracting Hidden States"
msgstr "## 提取隐藏状态"

msgid ""
"The `extract_hidden_states` method is a special speculative decoding mode "
"that does not perform actual speculation. Instead, it extracts hidden states"
" from specified layers of the target model and saves them to disk. This is "
"primarily used for collecting training data for EAGLE-style draft models."
msgstr ""
"`extract_hidden_states` "
"方法是一种特殊的推测解码模式，它不执行实际的推测。相反，它从目标模型的指定层提取隐藏状态并将其保存到磁盘。这主要用于为 EAGLE "
"风格的草稿模型收集训练数据。"

msgid ""
"> [!NOTE]\n"
"> This method produces only 1 output token per request. The primary output is the hidden states saved to disk, not the generated text."
msgstr ""
"> [!NOTE]\n"
"> 此方法每个请求仅生成 1 个输出令牌。主要输出是保存到磁盘的隐藏状态，而不是生成的文本。"

msgid "Key configuration parameters:"
msgstr "关键配置参数："

msgid ""
"1. **`num_speculative_tokens`**: Must be set to `1`. This method does not "
"perform actual speculation, so the value is fixed."
msgstr "1. **`num_speculative_tokens`**：必须设置为 `1`。此方法不执行实际推测，因此该值是固定的。"

msgid ""
"2. **`eagle_aux_hidden_state_layer_ids`**: List of layer indices from which "
"to extract hidden states. For example, `[2, 18, 34]` extracts from layers 2,"
" 18, and 34."
msgstr ""
"2. **`eagle_aux_hidden_state_layer_ids`**：要从中提取隐藏状态的层索引列表。例如，`[2, 18, 34]` "
"从第 2、18 和 34 层提取。"

msgid ""
"3. **`kv_connector`**: Must be set to `\"ExampleHiddenStatesConnector\"` to "
"enable saving hidden states to disk."
msgstr ""
"3. **`kv_connector`**：必须设置为 `\"ExampleHiddenStatesConnector\"` "
"以启用将隐藏状态保存到磁盘。"

msgid ""
"4. **`kv_role`**: Must be set to `\"kv_producer\"` for the extraction mode."
msgstr "4. **`kv_role`**：对于提取模式，必须设置为 `\"kv_producer\"`。"

msgid ""
"5. **`shared_storage_path`**: Directory where hidden states will be saved as"
" `.safetensors` files (one per request)."
msgstr "5. **`shared_storage_path`**：隐藏状态将保存为 `.safetensors` 文件（每个请求一个文件）的目录。"

msgid "## Dynamic Speculative Decoding {: #dynamic-speculative-decoding }"
msgstr "## 动态推测解码 {: #dynamic-speculative-decoding }"

msgid ""
"Dynamic Speculative Decoding adapts the number of draft tokens (K) at "
"runtime, instead of always using a fixed `num_speculative_tokens`. This "
"helps keep speculative decoding beneficial as concurrency and draft "
"confidence change. vLLM Ascend currently provides two approaches:"
msgstr ""
"动态推测解码在运行时自适应调整草稿令牌数量（K），而不是始终使用固定的 "
"`num_speculative_tokens`。这有助于在并发度和草稿置信度变化时，继续发挥推测解码的收益。vLLM Ascend 当前提供两种方案："

msgid ""
"- **Confidence-head based (DSpark)**: adjust the per-request verify length using the DSpark confidence head.\n"
"- **Batch-size based (Autoregressive)**: select a shared K from concurrency ranges via `num_speculative_tokens_per_batch_size`."
msgstr ""
"- **基于 Confidence Head（DSpark）**：使用 DSpark confidence head 调整每个请求的验证长度。\n"
"- **基于 Batch Size（自回归）**：通过 `num_speculative_tokens_per_batch_size` 按并发区间选择共享的 K。"

msgid "### Confidence-head based (DSpark)"
msgstr "### 基于 Confidence Head（DSpark）"

msgid ""
"This approach adapts how many drafted tokens are verified per request. It "
"can reduce verify cost when the drafter is less confident about later "
"tokens, while still allowing longer speculation when confidence is high."
msgstr ""
"该方案按请求自适应调整参与验证的草稿令牌数量。当草稿模型对靠后位置的令牌信心较低时，可以降低验证开销；当信心较高时，仍可保留更长的推测长度。"

msgid ""
"> [!NOTE]\n"
"> This is an **exploratory** feature and currently targets **model runner v1** only. The supported dynamic method relies on the DSpark **confidence head**. For other proposers such as DFlash, non-neural-parameter-based dynamic schemes are under exploration. Among DSpark draft models, only the **Qwen** series is supported today; support for models such as GLM and DeepSeek is being added incrementally."
msgstr ""
"> [!NOTE]\n"
"> 这是一个**探索性**功能，目前仅面向 **model runner v1**。当前支持的动态方法依赖 DSpark 的 **confidence head**。对于 DFlash 等其他提议方法，正在探索不依赖神经网络参数的动态方案。在 DSpark 草稿模型中，目前仅支持 **Qwen** 系列；GLM、DeepSeek 等模型的支持正在陆续实现。"

msgid "#### How it works"
msgstr "#### 工作原理"

msgid ""
"When `dynamic_spec_config.method` is set to `\"dspark\"`, the DSpark "
"proposer:"
msgstr "当 `dynamic_spec_config.method` 设置为 `\"dspark\"` 时，DSpark 提议者会："

msgid ""
"1. Runs the draft model as usual to produce up to `num_speculative_tokens` draft tokens.\n"
"2. Uses the DSpark confidence head to estimate per-position acceptance likelihood for each request.\n"
"3. Periodically recomputes a shared per-request verify budget from those confidence scores.\n"
"4. Allocates that budget across requests, so each request keeps only a prefix of draft tokens for verification."
msgstr ""
"1. 按常规方式运行草稿模型，生成最多 `num_speculative_tokens` 个草稿令牌。\n"
"2. 使用 DSpark confidence head 估计每个请求在各个位置上的接受可能性。\n"
"3. 基于这些置信度分数，周期性重新计算共享的每请求验证预算。\n"
"4. 将该预算分配给各个请求，使每个请求只保留一段草稿令牌前缀用于验证。"

msgid ""
"The resulting per-request verify lengths are consumed by the model runner "
"when collecting draft tokens for the target-model verify step."
msgstr "得到的每请求验证长度会在模型运行器收集目标模型验证阶段所用的草稿令牌时被消费。"

msgid "#### Configuration"
msgstr "#### 配置"

msgid ""
"Enable this approach through `additional_config.dynamic_spec_config`. See "
"[Additional Configuration](../configuration/additional_config.md) for the "
"full parameter reference."
msgstr ""
"通过 `additional_config.dynamic_spec_config` "
"启用该方案。完整参数说明请参见[附加配置](../configuration/additional_config.md)。"

msgid ""
"You still need a normal DSpark `speculative_config` (`method: \"dspark\"`, "
"draft model path, and `num_speculative_tokens`). Dynamic decoding only "
"decides how many of those drafted tokens are verified per request."
msgstr ""
"你仍需配置常规的 DSpark `speculative_config`（`method: \"dspark\"`、草稿模型路径以及 "
"`num_speculative_tokens`）。动态解码只决定每个请求实际验证其中多少个草稿令牌。"

msgid "#### Offline inference example"
msgstr "#### 离线推理示例"

msgid "### Batch-size based (Autoregressive)"
msgstr "### 基于 Batch Size（自回归）"

msgid ""
"This approach selects a shared speculative length K from the current "
"concurrency (batch size). It is intended for autoregressive draft methods "
"such as MTP, EAGLE / EAGLE-3, DFlash, and n-gram."
msgstr ""
"该方案根据当前并发度（batch size）选择共享的推测长度 K，适用于 MTP、EAGLE / EAGLE-3、DFlash、n-gram "
"等自回归草稿方法。"

msgid "#### Why is it needed?"
msgstr "#### 为什么需要它？"

msgid ""
"SD methods need to verify K tokens for each sequence during decoding. As "
"batch size (BS) increases, the effective batch becomes `BS * K`, which "
"increases the compute requirement during verification. When `BS * K` goes "
"beyond a critical batch size, speculative decoding can hurt decode speed "
"(TPOT). Batch-size based Dynamic SD tunes K to an optimal value so that "
"speculative decoding remains beneficial."
msgstr ""
"推测解码方法在解码阶段需要为每个序列验证 K 个令牌。随着 batch size（BS）增大，有效 batch 变为 `BS * "
"K`，从而增加验证阶段的计算量。当 `BS * K` 超过临界 batch size 时，推测解码反而可能损害解码速度（TPOT）。基于 Batch "
"Size 的动态推测解码会将 K 调整到合适的值，使推测解码继续保持收益。"

msgid "#### Use cases"
msgstr "#### 使用场景"

msgid ""
"- Variable concurrency on the same deployment: K decreases as concurrency increases.\n"
"- RL rollout workloads that start with high BS and later shrink to a few long-tail requests: K can increase again toward the end of the rollout.\n"
"- Currently supports MTP, EAGLE-3, DFlash, n-gram, and similar methods. Suffix Decoding is already per-request dynamic, so an outer dynamic K is redundant or conflicting; this is an upstream constraint, not Ascend-specific. DSpark and `MTP + DCP + DSD` are currently not supported on this path."
msgstr ""
"- 同一部署下并发度变化：随着并发增加，K 会减小。\n"
"- RL rollout 场景：开始时 BS 较高，随后因少量长尾请求而缩小；在 rollout 后期 K 可以再次增大。\n"
"- 当前支持 MTP、EAGLE-3、DFlash、n-gram 等方法。Suffix Decoding 本身已是按请求动态的，外层动态 K 是冗余或冲突的；这是上游约束，并非 Ascend 特有问题。该路径当前不支持 DSpark 以及 `MTP + DCP + DSD`。"

msgid "#### `--speculative-config` schema"
msgstr "#### `--speculative-config` 配置格式"

msgid ""
"To use Batch-size based Dynamic SD, add "
"`num_speculative_tokens_per_batch_size` to the speculative config of a "
"supported method. It is a list of lists, where each entry is `[start_bs, "
"end_bs, optimal_K]`: when concurrency is within `[start_bs, end_bs]`, "
"`optimal_K` draft tokens are used. For example:"
msgstr ""
"要使用基于 Batch Size 的动态推测解码，请在受支持方法的 speculative config 中添加 "
"`num_speculative_tokens_per_batch_size`。它是一个二维列表，每个条目为 `[start_bs, end_bs, "
"optimal_K]`：当并发度落在 `[start_bs, end_bs]` 范围内时，使用 `optimal_K` 个草稿令牌。例如："

msgid "implies that:"
msgstr "含义如下："

msgid ""
"- K=3 will be used when the concurrency is in range [1, 64]\n"
"- K=1 will be used when the concurrency is in range [65, 128]\n"
"- K=0 will be used when the concurrency is in range [129, 512], i.e., no draft tokens will be produced."
msgstr ""
"- 当并发度在 [1, 64] 时使用 K=3\n"
"- 当并发度在 [65, 128] 时使用 K=1\n"
"- 当并发度在 [129, 512] 时使用 K=0，即不生成草稿令牌"

msgid "#### Online examples"
msgstr "#### 在线示例"

msgid "##### Dynamic SD Eagle Drafter"
msgstr "##### Dynamic SD Eagle 草稿模型"

msgid "##### Dynamic SD Eagle3 Drafter"
msgstr "##### Dynamic SD Eagle3 草稿模型"

msgid ""
"## Block Verify and Entropy Verify {: #block-verify-and-entropy-verify }"
msgstr "## 块验证和熵验证 {: #block-verify-and-entropy-verify }"

msgid ""
"vLLM Ascend provides two optional optimizations for the rejection sampler in"
" speculative decoding: **Block Verify** and **Entropy Verify**. These "
"features trade a small amount of output precision for improved inference "
"throughput."
msgstr ""
"vLLM Ascend 为推测解码中的拒绝采样器提供了两个可选优化：**块验证**和**熵验证**。这些功能以少量输出精度为代价，换取推理吞吐量的提升。"

msgid ""
"> [!WARNING]\n"
"> Both Block Verify and Entropy Verify modify the token acceptance criteria and may cause minor precision degradation (e.g., slightly different output tokens compared to the standard rejection sampler). Evaluate the quality impact on your specific workload before enabling them in production."
msgstr ""
"> [!WARNING]\n"
"> 块验证和熵验证都会修改令牌接受标准，并可能导致轻微的精度下降（例如，与标准拒绝采样器相比，输出令牌略有不同）。在生产环境中启用它们之前，请评估对特定工作负载的质量影响。"

msgid "### Block Verify"
msgstr "### 块验证"

msgid ""
"Block Verify evaluates all draft tokens as a block using cumulative "
"probability products, rather than checking each token independently. This "
"can improve the acceptance rate and reduce the overhead of rejection "
"sampling, especially when `num_speculative_tokens >= 3`."
msgstr ""
"块验证使用累积概率乘积将所有草稿令牌作为一个整体进行评估，而不是独立检查每个令牌。这可以提高接受率并减少拒绝采样的开销，尤其是在 "
"`num_speculative_tokens >= 3` 时。"

msgid "### Entropy Verify"
msgstr "### 熵验证"

msgid ""
"Entropy Verify adjusts the acceptance threshold based on the entropy of the "
"target distribution:"
msgstr "熵验证根据目标分布的熵调整接受阈值："

msgid ""
"- **High entropy** (uncertain distribution) → lower effective threshold → more tokens accepted\n"
"- **Low entropy** (confident distribution) → higher effective threshold → stricter rejection"
msgstr ""
"- **高熵**（不确定分布）→ 较低的有效阈值 → 接受更多令牌\n"
"- **低熵**（确定分布）→ 较高的有效阈值 → 更严格的拒绝"

msgid "This entropy-aware threshold is controlled by two parameters:"
msgstr "这个熵感知阈值由两个参数控制："

msgid ""
"- **`posterior_threshold`** (default: `0.95`, range: `(0, 1]`): The upper bound of the modified threshold. Even when entropy is very low, the effective threshold will not exceed this value.\n"
"- **`posterior_alpha`** (default: `0.4`, range: `>= 0`): Controls how strongly entropy influences the threshold. A higher alpha makes the threshold more sensitive to entropy changes, resulting in a higher acceptance rate for speculative tokens but also greater precision loss. You need to tune this value based on your specific model and dataset. When alpha is `0`, entropy has no effect and the threshold equals `posterior_threshold`."
msgstr ""
"- **`posterior_threshold`**（默认值：`0.95`，范围：`(0, 1]`）：修改后阈值的上限。即使熵非常低，有效阈值也不会超过此值。\n"
"- **`posterior_alpha`**（默认值：`0.4`，范围：`>= 0`）：控制熵对阈值的影响程度。alpha 值越高，阈值对熵变化越敏感，导致推测令牌的接受率更高，但精度损失也更大。您需要根据特定的模型和数据集调整此值。当 alpha 为 `0` 时，熵不起作用，阈值等于 `posterior_threshold`。"

msgid "### Usage"
msgstr "### 使用方法"

msgid "- Online inference"
msgstr "- 在线推理"

msgid "- Offline inference"
msgstr "- 离线推理"

msgid ""
"Both features can be enabled independently or together. When used together, "
"the cumulative acceptance from Block Verify is combined with the entropy-"
"adjusted threshold from Entropy Verify."
msgstr "这两个功能可以独立或同时启用。同时使用时，块验证的累积接受率将与熵验证的熵调整阈值相结合。"

msgid "| Method | Description |"
msgstr "| 方法 | 描述 |"

msgid "| `ngram` | Match n-grams from the prompt |"
msgstr "| `ngram` | 从提示中匹配 n-gram |"

msgid ""
"| `suffix` | Suffix-based pattern matching (requires Arctic Inference) |"
msgstr "| `suffix` | 基于后缀的模式匹配（需要 Arctic Inference） |"

msgid "| `medusa` | Medusa heads embedded in the target model |"
msgstr "| `medusa` | 嵌入在目标模型中的 Medusa 头 |"

msgid "| `eagle` | EAGLE-based draft model |"
msgstr "| `eagle` | 基于 EAGLE 的草稿模型 |"

msgid "| `eagle3` | EAGLE-3 based draft model |"
msgstr "| `eagle3` | 基于 EAGLE-3 的草稿模型 |"

msgid "| `mtp` | Multi-Token Prediction with shared embedding head |"
msgstr "| `mtp` | 使用共享嵌入头的多令牌预测 |"

msgid "| `draft_model` | Generic external draft LLM |"
msgstr "| `draft_model` | 通用外部草稿 LLM |"

msgid "| `extract_hidden_states` | Extract hidden states for EAGLE training |"
msgstr "| `extract_hidden_states` | 提取隐藏状态用于 EAGLE 训练 |"

msgid "| `dflash` | Block diffusion-based parallel draft model |"
msgstr "| `dflash` | 基于块扩散的并行草稿模型 |"

msgid ""
"- **`method`** (str, required): The speculative decoding method. Must be one of the supported method names listed in the table above.\n"
"- **`num_speculative_tokens`** (int, required): Number of speculative tokens to generate per forward pass. Auto-filled from the draft model's `n_predict` config (e.g., MTP) or `suffix_decoding_max_tree_depth` (suffix method) when available.\n"
"    > **Note**: For PD Separation deployment, `num_speculative_tokens` should be subject to one of the following conditions:\n"
"    >\n"
"    > 1. Hybrid Mamba models (e.g., Qwen-Next and Qwen3.5 series): `num_speculative_tokens` should be equal on P nodes and D nodes.\n"
"    > 2. Other models: `num_speculative_tokens` on P nodes should be 1, and `num_speculative_tokens` on D nodes should be greater or equal to 1.\n"
"- **`model`** (str, optional): Path or HF repo ID for the draft model. Required for `eagle`, `eagle3`, `dflash`, `medusa`, and `draft_model`. Automatically resolved for `mtp` (reuses target model), `ngram`, `suffix`, and `extract_hidden_states`.\n"
"- **`draft_tensor_parallel_size`** (int, optional): Tensor parallelism size for the draft model. Can only be `1` or the same as the target model's tensor parallel size.\n"
"- **`disable_padded_drafter_batch`** (bool, default: `False`): Disable input padding for speculative decoding. If set to `True`, speculative input batches can contain sequences of different lengths, which may only be supported by certain attention backends. **Note:** Only effective with `eagle`, `eagle3`, `mtp`, `dflash`, `draft_model`, and `extract_hidden_states` methods."
msgstr ""
"- **`method`** (str, 必填): 推测解码方法。必须是上表中列出的受支持方法名称之一。\n"
"- **`num_speculative_tokens`** (int, 必填): 每次前向传播生成的推测令牌数量。当可用时，从草稿模型的 `n_predict` 配置（例如 MTP）或 `suffix_decoding_max_tree_depth`（后缀方法）自动填充。\n"
"    > **注意**: 对于 PD 分离部署，`num_speculative_tokens` 应满足以下条件之一：\n"
"    >\n"
"    > 1. 混合 Mamba 模型（例如 Qwen-Next 和 Qwen3.5 系列）：`num_speculative_tokens` 在 P 节点和 D 节点上应相等。\n"
"    > 2. 其他模型：P 节点上的 `num_speculative_tokens` 应为 1，D 节点上的 `num_speculative_tokens` 应大于或等于 1。\n"
"- **`model`** (str, 可选): 草稿模型的路径或 HF 仓库 ID。对于 `eagle`、`eagle3`、`dflash`、`medusa` 和 `draft_model` 是必需的。对于 `mtp`（重用目标模型）、`ngram`、`suffix` 和 `extract_hidden_states` 会自动解析。\n"
"- **`draft_tensor_parallel_size`** (int, 可选): 草稿模型的张量并行大小。只能是 `1` 或与目标模型的张量并行大小相同。\n"
"- **`disable_padded_drafter_batch`** (bool, 默认值: `False`): 禁用推测解码的输入填充。如果设置为 `True`，推测输入批次可以包含不同长度的序列，这可能仅受某些注意力后端支持。**注意:** 仅对 `eagle`、`eagle3`、`mtp`、`dflash`、`draft_model` 和 `extract_hidden_states` 方法有效。"

msgid "## Synthetic Rejection Sampling"
msgstr "## 合成拒绝采样"

msgid ""
"In addition to the default `standard` rejection sampling (which accepts a "
"draft token when `target_prob / draft_prob >= uniform`), vLLM Ascend "
"supports **synthetic** rejection sampling. In this mode each draft token at "
"position `i` is accepted with a configured probability `rates[i]`, compared "
"against a uniform random draw — **independent of the target/draft "
"probability match**. The first rejected position stops the request and emits"
" a recovered token; if every draft token is accepted, the bonus token is "
"appended."
msgstr ""
"除了默认的 `standard` 拒绝采样（当 `target_prob / draft_prob >= uniform` "
"时接受草稿令牌）之外，vLLM Ascend 还支持**合成**拒绝采样。在此模式下，位置 `i` 处的每个草稿令牌以配置的概率 `rates[i]` "
"被接受，并与均匀随机抽取进行比较——**与目标/草稿概率匹配无关**。第一个被拒绝的位置会停止请求并发出一个恢复令牌；如果所有草稿令牌都被接受，则追加奖励令牌。"

msgid "### Why use it"
msgstr "### 为什么使用它"

msgid ""
"Synthetic mode **decouples the verifier's acceptance logic from draft-model "
"quality**, letting you drive the speculative-decoding pipeline at a "
"controlled, fixed acceptance rate. It is useful for:"
msgstr "合成模式**将验证器的接受逻辑与草稿模型质量解耦**，使您能够以受控的固定接受率驱动推测解码流水线。它适用于："

msgid ""
"- **Benchmarking** the verify path (kernel + sampler + token assembly) throughput/latency at a known acceptance rate, without depending on a well-trained drafter.\n"
"- **Kernel validation** — because acceptance reduces to `uniform < rate`, the result is fully determined by the inputs. The e2e test compares the Ascend Triton kernel (`SYNTHETIC_MODE=True`) against the PyTorch reference under identical inputs, so the two must agree bit-for-bit.\n"
"- **Stress-testing** the high-acceptance regime of the speculative pipeline."
msgstr ""
"- **基准测试**验证路径（内核 + 采样器 + 令牌组装）在已知接受率下的吞吐量/延迟，而不依赖于训练良好的草稿模型。\n"
"- **内核验证**——因为接受简化为 `uniform < rate`，结果完全由输入决定。端到端测试在相同输入下将 Ascend Triton 内核（`SYNTHETIC_MODE=True`）与 PyTorch 参考实现进行比较，两者必须逐位一致。\n"
"- **压力测试**推测流水线的高接受率场景。"

msgid ""
"> [!WARNING]\n"
"> Synthetic mode accepts draft tokens regardless of whether they match the target distribution, so the generated output is **not semantically correct**. Use it for benchmarking and validation only, **never for production serving**."
msgstr ""
"> [!WARNING]\n"
"> 合成模式接受草稿令牌，无论它们是否与目标分布匹配，因此生成的输出**在语义上不正确**。仅将其用于基准测试和验证，**切勿用于生产环境服务**。"

msgid "### How to use"
msgstr "### 如何使用"

msgid ""
"Synthetic mode is configured through `speculative_config`, alongside the "
"proposer settings:"
msgstr "合成模式通过 `speculative_config` 与提议者设置一起配置："

msgid ""
"- **`rejection_sample_method`** (str, default: `\"standard\"`): set to `\"synthetic\"` to enable.\n"
"- **`synthetic_acceptance_rates`** (list[float], optional): per-position acceptance rates. Must have length `num_speculative_tokens`, each entry in `[0, 1]`, and be monotonically non-increasing.\n"
"- **`synthetic_acceptance_length`** (float, optional): target mean acceptance length in `[1, num_speculative_tokens + 1]`, resolved internally to an equivalent `synthetic_acceptance_rates` schedule. Mutually exclusive with `synthetic_acceptance_rates`; exactly one must be provided when `rejection_sample_method == \"synthetic\"`."
msgstr ""
"- **`rejection_sample_method`**（str，默认值：`\"standard\"`）：设置为 `\"synthetic\"` 以启用。\n"
"- **`synthetic_acceptance_rates`**（list[float]，可选）：每个位置的接受率。长度必须为 `num_speculative_tokens`，每个条目在 `[0, 1]` 范围内，并且单调不递增。\n"
"- **`synthetic_acceptance_length`**（float，可选）：目标平均接受长度，范围为 `[1, num_speculative_tokens + 1]`，内部解析为等效的 `synthetic_acceptance_rates` 调度。与 `synthetic_acceptance_rates` 互斥；当 `rejection_sample_method == \"synthetic\"` 时必须且只能提供其中一个。"

